# assets.links — INVENTORY of the big installation files.
#
# What this file is: the list of large installers mosquitOmarchy expects, where
# each one belongs, and its sha256. `download-assets.sh --check` verifies what
# you already have; `--status` shows it.
#
# What it is NOT: a download list. There is deliberately no URL column.
#
#   Ableton and Bitwig are behind account logins, and a ~4 GB zip has no
#   business in a git clone. So these files are supplied BY HAND, dropped into
#   the folder named on the left, and this file is how the repo knows whether
#   you have. An earlier version carried a placeholder host here, which was
#   worse than useless: it made the script try to fetch files that were already
#   on disk, and it said so in French inside an English repository.
#
# If one is missing, the module that needs it greys itself out in Setup rather
# than failing, and download-assets.sh names the file and the folder to put it
# in. Nothing else in the install is blocked by it.
#
# Line format:  <path relative to the repo root> | <sha256>
# Example:      scripts/apps/ableton/ableton_live_suite_12.4.5_64.zip | <sha>
#
# The checksum is OPTIONAL: leave it empty and the file is inventoried by
# PRESENCE only. That is the right trade for something enormous — hashing an
# 11 GB zip on every --check costs more than the answer is worth, and it is the
# same presence question Setup's greying already asks with a glob.

# ─── Ableton Live (editions) ───
# The native installer install-ableton-latest.run fetches itself through
# setup-ableton.sh --check-update; only the edition zips are inventoried here.
scripts/apps/ableton/ableton_live_intro_12.4.5_64.zip | 28427dbc4a33dd082ebe3b2f6942023087199a386cbf62edb73d0ffb80440e2b
scripts/apps/ableton/ableton_live_suite_12.3.6_64.zip | 270fe1027e6174ffb8ae061841b11338da326d75dd939df72d9c5ea1544f2074
scripts/apps/ableton/ableton_live_suite_12.4.5_64.zip | 67fe60e07cff6d22823504eab0efab4c60075ec8f53e0388dbb47ec9558cb9ad

# ─── Guitar Pro 8 ───
# Public URL, but still your download to do: https://downloads.guitar-pro.com/gp8/
scripts/apps/guitarpro/guitar-pro-8-setup.exe | 642eb400725ee7493de1695dafdd2cc12836c72ed6c4ea37799fbd767ea35d6e

