# From your Bitwig account: https://www.bitwig.com/download/
scripts/apps/bitwig/bitwig-studio-6.0-beta-6.deb | 65946f603eeed3bbce2ac7027c722291254c1bb31ce30d81face524b2fbd33df
scripts/apps/bitwig/PATCH/bitwig.jar | 6468ee6602239dc8185dcc2653d80c7d449b6ee5515d17667aaef3efd396cc54

# ─── DaVinci Resolve ───
